          "title": "You'll want to know: ограничивать",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ограничивать (ograníchivat) — \"to limit, to restrict\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Родители ограничивают время у компьютера. Rodíteli ograníchivayut vrémya u kompyútera. The parents limit time at the computer."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective ограничить. Ограничиваться + instrumental — to be limited to."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ограничивать (ograníchivat) is built from о- and граница \"a border\", which is built on грань \"an edge\": to limit a thing is to draw a border round it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
