          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "лишать (lishát) is usually linked with лишний \"extra, too many\" and лишь \"only\", on an old Slavic root meaning excess: to take away what someone has."
            }
          ]
        },
